<SiteLayout page="privacy">
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="wrap privacy-notice">
<span class="kicker">Privacy</span>
<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="privacy-draft" role="note"><strong>Draft for owner review. Do not publish while any <code>[CONFIRM_…]</code> field remains.</strong> This wording describes the agreed migration once its behaviour has been tested; it is not a statement that the new implementation already passes those tests.</p>
<p>Last updated: [CONFIRM_PUBLICATION_DATE].</p>
<p>This notice explains how Shaantha Wellness handles personal data when you visit shaanthawellness.com or contact us about a massage.</p>
<h2>Who is responsible</h2>
<p>The data controller is <strong>Tabea Christiane Both</strong>, a self-employed practitioner trading as Shaantha Ayurvedic Massage &amp; Wellness Sagres, based at <strong>Rua da Botelha, 8650-359 Sagres</strong>, Portugal.</p>
<p>For privacy questions or to exercise your rights, contact us on <a href="https://wa.me/351938132927" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp at +351 938 132 927</a>.</p>
<p>[CONFIRM_DPO_APPLICABILITY_AND_CONTACT_IF_ANY]</p>
<h2>Visiting this website</h2>
<p>The website is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub receives the requests needed to deliver its pages and records visitors' IP addresses for security purposes. This happens even when you decline analytics. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
<p>Our website's fonts and photographs are served with the website. Visiting a page does not request fonts from Google's font service.</p>
<p>We use browser storage to remember your analytics choice in <code>shaantha-consent</code>. When you make a new choice, we also store its date and the notice version in <code>shaantha-consent-receipt</code>. These records support your privacy settings, rather than track your browsing, and remain in your browser until you change your choice or clear the website's storage. An existing saved choice is retained without recording it as a new consent. You can change your choice through <strong>Cookie settings</strong>.</p>
<h2>Optional analytics</h2>
<p>If you choose <strong>Accept</strong>, we load Google Analytics to understand which pages visitors read and which website links they use. The information can include page visits, approximate location, device/browser information and identifiers held in analytics cookies. Clicking a WhatsApp link may be counted as a contact-link click; it does not tell us whether you complete a booking.</p>
<p>The legal basis for this analytics processing is your consent. You can browse and contact us without accepting. Before you accept, or if you decline, our website does not load the analytics tag or send analytics requests to Google.</p>
<p>Analytics is provided by <strong>[CONFIRM_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_CONTRACTING_ENTITY]</strong>. Its <code>_ga</code> cookie distinguishes visitors, and <code>_ga_&lt;measurement-id&gt;</code> stores session state. The website tag configures analytics cookies to expire after 180 days; their expiry may be renewed on a later visit while you continue to allow analytics. The cookie inventory must be confirmed as <strong>[CONFIRM_OBSERVED_ANALYTICS_COOKIE_INVENTORY]</strong> before publication. The website tag has advertising features and Google Signals disabled.</p>
<p>The configured retention for user and event data in the Analytics account is <strong>[CONFIRM_GA_RETENTION_AND_ACTIVITY_RESET]</strong>; aggregated reporting is <strong>[CONFIRM_AGGREGATED_REPORT_RETENTION_CRITERION]</strong>. Those account settings have not yet been verified for this notice. Cookie expiry and the retention of data in the Analytics account are different settings.</p>
<p>You can withdraw your consent through <strong>Cookie settings</strong> by choosing <strong>Reject</strong>. We stop further analytics collection and remove analytics cookies that our website can access. Withdrawing consent does not change the lawfulness of processing that took place before withdrawal. Contact us if you wish to request deletion of data already held. See <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's information about Analytics data</a>.</p>
<h2>Location and external links</h2>
<p>The location image is hosted with this website. Viewing it does not connect your browser to Google Maps or load an embedded map. Choosing <strong>Open in Google Maps</strong> takes you to Google's external website, where Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a> applies.</p>
<h2>Contacting us and making a booking</h2>
<p>When you message us, we receive the details you send, such as your name, phone number, message and requested appointment. We use the information needed to reply, arrange your appointment and provide the service you request. The legal basis for those necessary steps is taking action at your request before a contract, or performing our contract with you.</p>
<p>Providing contact and appointment details is your choice. If you do not provide the information needed for an appointment, we may be unable to reply or arrange it. We retain messages and booking records <strong>[CONFIRM_BOOKING_AND_MESSAGE_RETENTION_CRITERIA]</strong>. Where we must retain records by law, the applicable categories and periods are <strong>[CONFIRM_LEGAL_RECORDS_AND_PERIODS_OR_NOT_APPLICABLE]</strong>.</p>
<p>WhatsApp also processes information for its own purposes under its <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy-eea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EEA privacy policy</a>. Its policy does not replace our responsibility for the messages and records we receive.</p>
<p>[CONFIRM_ANY_HEALTH_DATA_INTAKE_AND_SEPARATE_NOTICE_IF_APPLICABLE]</p>
<h2>Recipients and international transfers</h2>
<p>The providers described above receive information necessary for their services. Other recipients of the records we hold are <strong>[CONFIRM_OTHER_RECIPIENTS_OR_NONE]</strong>.</p>
<p>Some providers may process data outside the European Economic Area. The relevant entities, destinations and transfer safeguards for our services are <strong>[CONFIRM_TRANSFER_ENTITIES_DESTINATIONS_AND_VALID_MECHANISMS]</strong>. You can obtain information or copies of the applicable safeguards from <strong>[CONFIRM_SAFEGUARDS_CONTACT_OR_LINKS]</strong>.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Depending on the processing, you can request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability of your personal data, and object to processing where that right applies. Contact the privacy contact above. We may ask for proportionate additional information if we reasonably need to confirm your identity.</p>
<p>You may also complain to Portugal's <a href="https://www.cnpd.pt/cidadaos/participacoes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Comissão Nacional de Proteção de Dados (CNPD)</a>.</p>
<p>[CONFIRM_AUTOMATED_DECISIONS_OR_PROFILING_AND_REQUIRED_EXPLANATION_IF_APPLICABLE]</p>
<p>If we materially change how we use personal data, we will update this notice and request new consent where required.</p>
<div class="cta-box">
  <p>Questions about this page? Reach out any time.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/351938132927?text=Hi!%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20the%20privacy%20policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
</main>
</SiteLayout>
